{"1941450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fragments", "steam_appid": 1941450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941450/extras/fc8684039473ee7e7bfe15bdc849032e.avif?t=1770570482\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941450/extras_big/fc8684039473ee7e7bfe15bdc849032e.webp?t=1770570482 width=1560 height=268 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fragments</strong> is a multiplayer dungeon crawler where groups of three players explore dangerous places to find the lost fragments, pieces of ancient power containing spells and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will face tough enemies and rival teams, making every run a unique experience of strategy &amp; adaptation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941450/extras/53fb296648c8fdbc7f5fd618273e2f13.avif?t=1770570482\" width=1000 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941450/extras/a7786fe3349664128c98db4a39d6fb72.poster.avif?t=1770570482\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941450/extras/a7786fe3349664128c98db4a39d6fb72.webm?t=1770570482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941450/extras/a7786fe3349664128c98db4a39d6fb72.mp4?t=1770570482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a lost dungeon crawling with monsters and hidden dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful essences that grant spells and abilities, making every run feel different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat powerful bosses to discover legendary essences.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941450/extras/7ae065074ae19c2af37e879afc2ef98c.avif?t=1770570482\" width=1000 height=128 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941450/extras/1c87c4965992f5d48037723fd51cd31e.poster.avif?t=1770570482\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941450/extras/1c87c4965992f5d48037723fd51cd31e.webm?t=1770570482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941450/extras/1c87c4965992f5d48037723fd51cd31e.mp4?t=1770570482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the game as teams of 1, 2 or 3 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expedition difficulty and rewards dynamically adapt to your team size</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941450/extras/0e8b6c6141d712f5500b58f34425b335.avif?t=1770570482\" width=1000 height=128 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941450/extras/18cc1bb28805bfb689e3d10f21ad5947.poster.avif?t=1770570482\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941450/extras/18cc1bb28805bfb689e3d10f21ad5947.webm?t=1770570482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941450/extras/18cc1bb28805bfb689e3d10f21ad5947.mp4?t=1770570482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the arena and fight for survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outplay your opponents with precise movement, smart ability usage and perfect timing</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941450/extras/fc8684039473ee7e7bfe15bdc849032e.avif?t=1770570482\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941450/extras_big/fc8684039473ee7e7bfe15bdc849032e.webp?t=1770570482 width=1560 height=268 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fragments</strong> is a multiplayer dungeon crawler where groups of three players explore dangerous places to find the lost fragments, pieces of ancient power containing spells and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will face tough enemies and rival teams, making every run a unique experience of strategy &amp; adaptation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941450/extras/53fb296648c8fdbc7f5fd618273e2f13.avif?t=1770570482\" width=1000 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941450/extras/a7786fe3349664128c98db4a39d6fb72.poster.avif?t=1770570482\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941450/extra